## Canonical rules

- **Cold start:** read `docs/BRIEFING.md` (generated, committed — phase · active item · do-nots), then `AGENTS.md`.
- **`AGENTS.md` at the repo root is the canonical rules file** — stack facts, architecture invariants, standing behavioral rules, how work is executed (one card · timebox · escalation), gates, and what's off-limits live THERE, not here. If anything disagrees, `AGENTS.md` and the code win. Do not restate its content in this file — the copies rot (the gate description already did once).
- **Before any cross-module edit, read `docs/reference/control-flow.md`.** Most edges here are not imports — they run through injected `callbacks`/`deps` objects, the `MSG.*` wire protocol, and zustand subscriptions. Grep will call live functions dead, and `src/main.js` is one 4,500-line closure holding ~84 unexported inner functions.
- Session state: `docs/STATUS.md`. Gates: `npm run qa` (chain defined in AGENTS.md § Commands); CI runs qa plus a production build.

## Brand (read first)

- **Product name:** Cart Clash
- **Active branch:** `cart-clash`
- **Naming freeze:** `docs/brand.md` — product vs legacy `cart-rave` infra IDs
- Do **not** rename Worker host, DO class `CartRaveServer`, PartySocket party id, or `cartRave*` localStorage keys without a cutover plan
- Do **not** use "Cart Rave" or `next-level` in new user-facing copy or living docs
- Classic level display name: **CART RAVE** (jam tribute; product is still Cart Clash)

## Progression unlocks (dev)

- **Vite dev unlocks everything by default** (levels, patterns, sunglasses, custom color) so agents are not blocked by gates.
- Source: `src/stores/unlockStore.js` → `isDevUnlockAll()` · config docs: `src/unlockConfig.js` header.
- **Test real gates in dev:** `localStorage.cartRaveDevUnlocks = "off"` or `?devUnlocks=off`, then hard refresh. Console: `CartClashDevUnlocks.enableGates()`.
- **Force unlock:** `CartClashDevUnlocks.enableAll()` (any build) or `?devUnlocks=all` (**DEV builds only** — SEC-UNLOCK-1 closed that URL in prod; `?devUnlocks=off` still works everywhere).
- Production never auto-unlocks; do not rely on gates being open in prod builds.
- Lifetime progress still accumulates under `cartRaveUnlocks` while dev-unlock is on.

## Cursor notes

- **Role:** IDE surface + backup. **Equal heavy-lift defaults are Grok and Codex** (see AGENTS.md § Tool routing). Claude is demoted.
- Deep process: `docs/reference/agent-manual.md` (read when needed — not every session).
- Durable Object state persists across `wrangler deploy` — deploys do NOT reset in-memory server state.
- Use PowerShell for commands (`Select-String`, not `grep`; single-line commit messages with `-m "..."`).
- Behavior-changing diffs require human playtest on production before proceeding.
- `room.getConnections()` returns an Iterator — use spread or `for...of`, never `.map().join()`.
